<title>USA: Boeing gets $179 mln U.S. defense contract.</title>
<headline>Boeing gets $179 mln U.S. defense contract.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Boeing Co has received a $179 million U.S. defense contract for development work on wind-correction kits to make bombs carried by B-1B bombers more accurate, the Air Force said.</p>
<p>The contract is part of a new program for a &quot;Wind-Corrected Munitions Dispenser&quot; designed to be dropped by a several types of U.S. attack aircraft, the service said.</p>
